<div id="cap-nodes" style="display:contents"><a class="cap-node" href="/capabilities/pcba-box-build" data-cap-index="0"><div class="cap-node-count">3 Processes</div><div class="cap-node-name">PCBA &amp; Box Build</div><p class="cap-node-desc">Board and full product assembly in one group, from fine-pitch surface mount and chip on board through to enclosure, box build and the finished, tested unit.</p><span class="cap-node-cta">Explore &rarr;</span></a><a class="cap-node" href="/capabilities/osat" data-cap-index="1"><div class="cap-node-count">11 Processes</div><div class="cap-node-name">OSAT</div><p class="cap-node-desc">Semiconductor packaging from package design to finished device: power SiC and GaN, QFN and leadless, clear optical, hermetic ceramic, and ultra-small molded bodies.</p><span class="cap-node-cta">Explore &rarr;</span></a><a class="cap-node" href="/capabilities/microelectronic-assembly" data-cap-index="2"><div class="cap-node-count">4 Processes</div><div class="cap-node-name">Microelectronic Assembly</div><p class="cap-node-desc">The precision end of the group: flip chip, MEMS and sensor assembly, fine interconnect and micro-assembly, where placement is measured in microns.</p><span class="cap-node-cta">Explore &rarr;</span></a><a class="cap-node" href="/capabilities/rfid-smart-tags" data-cap-index="3"><div class="cap-node-count">2 Processes</div><div class="cap-node-name">RFID &amp; Smart Tags</div><p class="cap-node-desc">High-volume RFID inlays and ruggedized tags, with coil and antenna assembly, chip attach and lamination.</p><span class="cap-node-cta">Explore &rarr;</span></a><a class="cap-node" href="/capabilities/automation" data-cap-index="4"><div class="cap-node-count">2 Processes</div><div class="cap-node-name">Automation &amp; Smart Manufacturing</div><p class="cap-node-desc">The inspection, handling and data layer that runs underneath every line: in-line optical inspection, robotic handling and unit-level traceability.</p><span class="cap-node-cta">Explore &rarr;</span></a><a class="cap-node" href="/capabilities/dfx-jdm" data-cap-index="5"><div class="cap-node-count">3 Processes</div><div class="cap-node-name">DFx &amp; JDM Collaboration</div><p class="cap-node-desc">How we work with your engineering team before volume: design-for-excellence review, joint development and new product introduction.</p><span class="cap-node-cta">Explore &rarr;</span></a></div>
